				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser deleted" data-id="1361261"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/common--images/avatars/default/a16.png" alt=""/>(account deleted)</span> <span class="odate time_1348070994 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">19 Sep 2012 16:09</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1568414">
									

<p>I think the impulse was correct here. This is a fine tale, but I'm not sure how I would react to the &quot;Food Goo of Eternal Recurrence&quot; SCP article. I dig the concept of little fragments here and there hinting at other unidentified things within Foundation control.</p>

